abstract: >
  An automated high-precision instance segmentation and demographic census system
  developed for the endangered Black-faced Spoonbill (Platalea minor). The platform
  integrates YOLO11 deep neural architectures with Sliced Aided Hyper Inference (SAHI),
  Coordinate Attention (CoordAtt @ P3), and a deterministic cross-platform desktop studio
  supporting Windows, macOS, and Linux.
